  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support The Food Secure Village in Farafra Oasis, Egypt</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the project is to alleviate hunger and reduce its implications in terms of suffering and distress on the most vulnerable and destitute. The concept is to improve producers? well-being in terms of food security, nutrition, and economic opportunities through community-based activities and the expansion of social protection coverage. Addressing this multilayered predicament can take different approaches and several forms of solutions. A comprehensive and replicable fourfold approach is employed consisting of i) protecting the vulnerable, ii) preventing malnutrition risks, iii) empowering for self-sustainability, and iv) elevating local developmental capacity.</narrative>
  </description>
